---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Getting Started"
  description="Learn how to install and use Ash, the keyboard-driven React text editor."
>
  <h1>Getting Started</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Ash is a controlled React component. Install it, drop it in, style it your way.
  </p>

  <h2>Installation</h2>

  <p>Install Ash from npm:</p>

  <pre><code>npm install @rocktree/ash</code></pre>

  <p>Or with other package managers:</p>

  <pre><code>pnpm add @rocktree/ash
yarn add @rocktree/ash</code></pre>

  <h2>Basic Usage</h2>

  <p>
    Ash is a controlled component — you manage the state, it handles keyboard
    shortcuts and markdown-aware editing.
  </p>

  <pre><code>{`import { useState } from 'react';
import { Editor } from '@rocktree/ash';

function App() {
  const [text, setText] = useState('');

  return (
    <Editor
      value={text}
      onChange={setText}
      placeholder="Start writing..."
      className="w-full h-64 p-4 bg-gray-900 text-gray-100
                 font-mono text-sm resize-none focus:outline-none"
    />
  );
}`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Styling</h2>

  <p>
    Ash renders a plain <code>&lt;textarea&gt;</code> with no built-in styles. Use the
    <code>className</code> prop (or <code>style</code>) to style it however you like.
    Tailwind CSS works great:
  </p>

  <pre><code>{`<Editor
  value={text}
  onChange={setText}
  className="
    w-full h-96 p-4
    bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-100
    font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed
    border border-zinc-700 rounded-lg
    resize-none focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-500
  "
/>`}</code></pre>

  <h2>With TypeScript</h2>

  <p>
    Ash is written in TypeScript. You get full type safety out of the box:
  </p>

  <pre><code>{`import type { EditorProps } from '@rocktree/ash';

function MyEditor(props: Omit<EditorProps, 'value' | 'onChange'>) {
  const [text, setText] = useState('');
  return <Editor value={text} onChange={setText} {...props} />;
}`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Next Steps</h2>

  <ul>
    <li><a href="/docs/api-reference">API Reference</a> — all props and types</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/keyboard-shortcuts">Keyboard Shortcuts</a> — full shortcut list</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
